      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَكَّاشٌ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  A man <i>who scrutinizes</i> or <i>investigates,</i>
or <i>searches</i> or <i>examines</i> or <i>inquires into, affairs;</i>
(TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْكَشٌ</span></b> . (IDrd, K.)

